{"item_id": "zc_152", "sample_id": "wafer_00044800_007", "image_path": "D:\\pycode\\晶圆图研究\\data\\images\\wafer_00044800_007.png", "image_sha256": "7cd027f2c3208b288c8886747d930df5e71b9402a2b3707c7dcf65ee63cc5708", "answer": {"defect_class": "Edge_Ring", "morphology": "红色失效die密集分布于晶圆边缘一圈，多处相邻相连形成不规则环带，环带不完全连续且宽窄不一；内部绿色区域散布少量孤立红点和小簇，密度明显低于边缘", "radial_zone": "edge", "clock_direction": null, "extent_r": null, "caption_zh": "红色失效die密集分布于晶圆边缘整圈形成不规则环带，内部散布少量孤立红点", "uncertainty": "边缘环带并非完全连续，内部亦有散点，若按边缘局部集中判读则为Edge_Loc；此处按整圈密集判为Edge_Ring"}, "teacher_class": "Edge_Ring", "label_source": "public_dataset_original_class", "description_source": "GLM_raw_with_Codex_model_visual_review", "gold_source": "class_only_public_label; descriptive_fields_are_model_candidates", "human_annotator_count": 0}
