{"item_id": "zc_168", "sample_id": "wafer_00045613_024", "image_path": "D:\\pycode\\晶圆图研究\\data\\images\\wafer_00045613_024.png", "image_sha256": "fc8011039512f0c223fb6d0daf2037a528b9a0a6ae48d05d40f6851345826109", "answer": {"defect_class": "Edge_Loc", "morphology": "红色失效die以孤立点及横向相邻die组成的短条状散布于晶圆全图，右上区域红色略显密集；未见大片连续失效区、环形或边缘集中模式；绿色合格die占绝大多数。", "radial_zone": "global", "clock_direction": null, "extent_r": null, "caption_zh": "晶圆全图散布孤立及横向短条状的红色失效die，右上区域略显密集，绿色合格die占绝大多数。", "uncertainty": "右上区域红点略多，但是否构成可辨认的局部模式无法判断；横向短条之间的关联性无法判断。"}, "teacher_class": "Random", "label_source": "public_dataset_original_class", "description_source": "GLM_raw_with_Codex_model_visual_review", "gold_source": "class_only_public_label; descriptive_fields_are_model_candidates", "human_annotator_count": 0}
{"item_id": "zc_169", "sample_id": "wafer_00045624_003", "image_path": "D:\\pycode\\晶圆图研究\\data\\images\\wafer_00045624_003.png", "image_sha256": "470cc64a12df03f96963912f68d1b6205b6f8bf6b7bd43a33ea8352124652806", "answer": {"defect_class": "Center", "morphology": "红色失效die以孤立散点为主，夹杂少量横向或纵向相邻die的短条，散布于晶圆全图；晶圆中心附近有一小簇相邻的红色die；未见大片连续失效区或环形结构；绿色合格die占绝大多数。", "radial_zone": "global", "clock_direction": null, "extent_r": null, "caption_zh": "晶圆全图散布孤立的红色失效点及少量短条，中心附近有一小簇红色die，绿色合格die占绝大多数。", "uncertainty": "中心附近的小簇范围很小，是否为局部聚集无法判断；散点分布的性质无法进一步判断。"}, "teacher_class": "Random", "label_source": "public_dataset_original_class", "description_source": "GLM_raw_with_Codex_model_visual_review", "gold_source": "class_only_public_label; descriptive_fields_are_model_candidates", "human_annotator_count": 0}
{"item_id": "zc_170", "sample_id": "wafer_00045629_003", "image_path": "D:\\pycode\\晶圆图研究\\data\\images\\wafer_00045629_003.png", "image_sha256": "db83aea0729ec67e3cce7bfa73c1ef48cf31815614fbd7e87b06c573d73a1063", "answer": {"defect_class": "Scratch", "morphology": "一条斜向的红色失效条带从晶圆中心附近向左下方连续延伸至边缘，呈折线状排列；条带在左下边缘处略有加宽；其余区域绿色为主，散布孤立的红色失效点和少量横向或纵向短条。", "radial_zone": "middle", "clock_direction": "约7-8点钟方向", "extent_r": null, "caption_zh": "一条斜向红色失效条带从晶圆中心附近延伸至左下边缘，其余区域绿色为主并散布孤立红色失效点。", "uncertainty": "条带起点靠近中心、末端到达边缘，径向带跨越middle与edge；条带成因无法判断。"}, "teacher_class": "Scratch", "label_source": "public_dataset_original_class", "description_source": "GLM_raw_with_Codex_model_visual_review", "gold_source": "class_only_public_label; descriptive_fields_are_model_candidates", "human_annotator_count": 0}
