{"item_id": "zc_175", "sample_id": "wafer_00045691_006", "image_path": "D:\\pycode\\晶圆图研究\\data\\images\\wafer_00045691_006.png", "image_sha256": "cc925f02a3c5aea71939ae243902b1d1ae3a049943add8e4990b377142963402", "answer": {"defect_class": "Random", "morphology": "红色失效die密度很高，与绿色合格die混杂分布于整个晶圆，全片呈红绿交错的散点混合外观，未见环带、边缘集中、中心块或线状等几何主图案", "radial_zone": "global", "clock_direction": null, "extent_r": null, "caption_zh": "晶圆全片被高密度失效die与合格die混杂覆盖，失效分布无几何形状主图案。", "uncertainty": "失效密度接近半数且全片均匀，未观察到可归类的几何图案，类别选择存在模糊"}, "teacher_class": "Random", "label_source": "public_dataset_original_class", "description_source": "GLM_raw_with_Codex_model_visual_review", "gold_source": "class_only_public_label; descriptive_fields_are_model_candidates", "human_annotator_count": 0}
